      "date": "2026-11-06 13:57:53.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1: Verified+1\n\nPassed enforced test review-ldiskfs-dne-arm on RHEL 8.10 / x86_64, Rocky 9.8 / aarch64 uploaded by Onyx Autotest from onyx-180vm43: https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/03668b71-83d9-473c-8324-433de1be24ad ran 5 tests.",
